ab Goel", "first_name": "Rishab", "last_name": "Goel", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 12851790, "full_name": "Zhi Wen", "first_name": "Zhi", "last_name": "Wen", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 12851800, "full_name": "Julien Martel", "first_name": "Julien", "last_name": "Martel", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 12851797, "full_name": "Joumana Ghosn", "first_name": "Joumana", "last_name": "Ghosn", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/DDXPlus_Dataset/20043374", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p>We are releasing under the CC-BY licence a new large-scale dataset for Automatic Symptom Detection (ASD) and Automatic Diagnosis (AD) systems in the medical domain. The dataset contains patients synthesized using a proprietary medical knowledge base and a commercial rule-based AD system. Patients in the dataset are characterized by their socio-demographic data, a pathology they are suffering from, a set of symptoms and antecedents related to this pathology, and a differential diagnosis. The symptoms and antecedents can be binary, categorical and multi-choice, with the potential of leading to more efficient and natural interactions between ASD/AD systems and patients.\u00a0 To the best of our knowledge, this is the first large-scale dataset that includes the differential diagnosis, and non-binary symptoms and antecedents. For more information, please check our <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.09148\" target=\"_blank\">paper</a>.</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 15, "status": "public", "size": 178848960, "created_date": "2026-03-11T14:42:10Z", "modified_date": "2026-03-11T14:42:11Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["Automatic Diagnosis", "Automatic Symptom Detection", "Differential Diagnosis", "Synthetic Patients", "Diseases", "Health Care"], "keywords": ["Automatic Diagnosis", "Automatic Symptom Detection", "Differential Diagnosis", "Synthetic Patients", "Diseases", "Health Care"], "categories": [{"id": 27073, "title": "Epidemiology not elsewhere classified", "parent_id": 27040, "path": "/27001/27040/27073", "source_id": "420299", "taxonomy_id": 100}, {"id": 27094, "title": "Health care administration", "parent_id": 27076, "path": "/27001/27076/27094", "source_id": "420306", "taxonomy_id": 100}], "references": [], "has_linked_file": false, "citation": "Fansi Tchango, Arsene; Goel, Rishab; Wen, Zhi; Martel, Julien; Ghosn, Joumana (2022). DDXPlus Dataset. figshare. Dataset. https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.20043374.v15", "related_materials": [], "is_embargoed": false, "embargo_date": null, "embargo_type": "file", "embargo_title": "", "embargo_reason": "", "embargo_options": [], "id": 20043374, "title": "DDXPlus Dataset", "doi": "10.6084/m9.figshare.20043374.v15", "handle": "", "url": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/articles/20043374", "published_date": "2026-03-11T14:42:10Z", "thumb": "", "defined_type": 3, "defined_type_name": "dataset", "group_id": null, "url_private_api": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/account/articles/20043374", "url_public_api": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/articles/20043374", "url_private_html": "https://figshare.com/account/articles/20043374", "url_public_html": "https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/DDXPlus_Dataset/20043374", "timeline": {"posted": "2026-03-11T14:42:10", "firstOnline": "2022-06-09"}, "resource_title": null, "resource_doi": null}